###Block: Descriptions
Aid (Legion's).MOD	DESC:+1 on attack rolls, +1 against fear, all creatures gain 1d8+(min(CASTERLEVEL,20)) temporary hp.
Align Fang (Legion's).MOD	DESC:Same as algin fang, but on multiple creatures.
Align Weapon (Legion's).MOD	DESC:Multiple weapons at a distance becomes good, evil, lawful, or chaotic.
Bigby's Slapping Hand.MOD	DESC:Distract target provoking an attack of opportunity [negate with DC 20 Concentration check].
Conviction (Legion's).MOD	DESC:+2 morale bonus to allies; see text.
Curse of Impending Blades (Legion's).MOD	DESC:-2 penalty to AC to all creatures.
Curse of Petty Failing.MOD	DESC:-2 penalty to attack and saving throws.
Curse of Petty Failing (Legion's).MOD	DESC:creatures affected; -2 penalty to attack and saving throws.
Fire Shield (Legion's).MOD	DESC:Creatures attacking sunjects take fire damage; you're protected from heat or cold.
Guided Arrow.MOD	DESC:Targets don't get AC bonus from cover except total cover.
Mordenkainen's Buzzing Bee.MOD	DESC:Creates a bee that imposes a -10 penalty to all Move Silently and Concentration checks; DC 10 on Concentration checks to cast.
Righteous Fury (Miniature Version).MOD	DESC:Subject's charge attack deals double damage of first attack.
Snake's Swiftness (Legion's).MOD	DESC:Subjects may make another single attack melee or ranged; see text.
Undeniable Gravity.MOD	DESC:Flying creatures force 60 feet down each round; see text.
Undeniable Gravity (Legion's).MOD	DESC:as undeniable gravity only affects multiple flying creatures.
